<title>POLAND: Drosed Q1 net rises to PLN 1.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Drosed Q1 net rises to PLN 1.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drosed preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.68 vs	1.12</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.43 vs	0.87</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.39 vs	0.39</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Siedleckie Zaklady Drobiarskie Drosed SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 45.23 vs     26.47</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  43.61 vs     25.42</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.04 vs	0.48</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    10.32 vs	0.03</p>
<p>    financial costs			  9.57 vs	0.28</p>
<p>    investment				 3.38 vs	2.36</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
